Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Seventh Episode\NMagic Water
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was deceived\Nby the fake Tink...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I was thrown down\Ninto the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There, a mysterious gas\Nblinded me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I finally returned\Nto the castle with difficulty,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,only to find\Na fake Sapphire there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will not give up!\NWhatever happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will thwart this conspiracy\Nand Dad and Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This sounds to me like\Nthe laughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! And today I will succeed\Nin stealing your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless! Don't you want to know\Nwhere your father and mother are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You know where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand...\NYou kidnapped my father and my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me where they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell you, if in exchange\Nyou give me your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone crane,\Nfly to my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where am I?\N- This is my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me...\NWhere are my father and my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, as promised I'll tell you:\Nthey are on Snake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Snake Island?\N- Yes! They are there, motionless...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...and they don't say a word!\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With a spell of mine, I turned\Nthem into stone statues...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and now they can't even move a hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad are stone statues?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie this rope, I want\Nto go to Snake Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.02,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Untie this rope!\N- All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll untie you, but only after\Nyou've given your heart to Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Hecate, come here!\NHecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, answer me!\NHecate, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, come out! Maybe\Nyou don't like his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.90,0:05:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Father... Mother...\NI'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could do it,\Nbut I can't help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could see..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's too late!\NSoon Mephisto will return!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate, where are you?\N- I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, come on, answer me!\NWhere are you, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know where you've hidden yourself?\NAnswer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! She must have hidden\Nin one of these jars!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you!\NSo you're in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've caught you, Hecate!\NCome out, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, obey your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Dad..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, open the lid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't scold you,\Nbut please, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're hidden\Nin this jar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hecate,\NI am grateful to you for saving me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and get ready to run away!\NRun, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If Dad finds out that the lid\Ndoesn't open, he'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Hecate!\NPlease, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't break the jar with a\Nmagic spell if you are inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sapphire, hold\Non until we get to a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to treat\Nyour eyes, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already grateful to you\Nfor bringing me this far, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, be brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to reach Snake\NIsland before Dad arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that Dad\Nis really angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how long\NI've been asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the direction\Nhad changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...while I was sleeping,\Nbut it's the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are we at Snake Island already?\N- Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see my father and my mother\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You will see them soon, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- That is the Island of Snakes!\N- Really?! Finally, we are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight to the boat,\Nthere are many whirlpools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be careful,\Nbecause they are very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Where are you, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am safe, Sapphire!\NIs everything okay? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it was tough, finally\Nwe are on the Island of Snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! This is it?\NAnd where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be somewhere\Non this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, quick, hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is happening?\N- Be quiet! There are many...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...sea snakes on this island!\NIf they discover us, we will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! It's on your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have almost arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, look!\NThere are your father and your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your mother, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is her?!\NThis cold stone is my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mother!\NMy mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me: how\Ndo I break the spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One way is to have\Nmy father do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't think he\Nwould be willing to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And another way is\Nto pour over them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...the greatest possible amount of\Nthe blood of the one who loves them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest possible\Namount of blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I love them more than\Nanyone else! Then, if I pour...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...all my blood over them,\Nthe spell will be broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's right, isn't it?\N- But it's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It is possible! I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Mother! I will break the\Nspell that Mephisto has cast on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sapphire! If you do\Nsuch a thing, you will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me go!\N- Sapphire...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate! Hecate!\N- Here is my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mephisto...\N- Sapphire, it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Father! Mother..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw that body overboard\Nand let the fish eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But he is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have escaped\Nfrom some island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,To avoid unpleasant situations, it will\Nbe better to throw him back into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame to throw him back\Ninto the sea after we've saved him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait! Don't throw him overboard!\N- At your orders, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, don't you dare do\Nanything without my permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take a look at\Nhim. Bring him to my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hoped so much to be able to\Nsee you again one day, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And that day has come!\NBut now sleep well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and try to recover your\Nhealth soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where am I?\N- You've woken up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's me, Captain Blood!\N- Captain Blood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember me?\NYou saved me that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...when I was arrested\Nby the Grand Duke, a year ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, as you see,\NI'm a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to your eyes?\NCan't you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to you?\NTell me, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been a plot\Nby the Ice Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ice Queen?!\N- Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that soon\Nthe Ice Queen's army
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...will prepare\Nto occupy Silverland, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Mephisto and the fake Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they must be accomplices\Nof the Ice Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just\Nthe way she operates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned Ice Queen!\NAs soon as I see her again, I'll kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to do that, for a start,\Nwe have to heal your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Heal my eyes?\NBut can they be healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates travel the world\Nand hear many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard talk\Nof the Magic Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Magic Spring?!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wash your eyes\Nwith its magic water,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the water will remove the poison\Nand soon you will be able to see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Are you serious?\NDo you think I will be able to see again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.26,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We might encounter dangers\Non the way to the Black Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,where the Spring is located,\Nbut do not fear, I will protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid Blood is!\NI can't stand being entangled
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...in a dangerous undertaking\Nbecause of that brat! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:15:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold on the deck,\Nlet's go back to the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Blood!\NYou will pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that we\Nwill encounter dangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because to get there we\Nhave to pass Wild Rock...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and Koto Inlet.\N- Are they very dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! In the meantime\Ndrink this, it'll warm you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.22,0:15:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't drink alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you something\Nthat is much better than alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I put it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that I helped you,\Nbut why are you so kind to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't answer you\Njust like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is, I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see that this\Nwill do you much more good than alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- But what is it?\N- It's a dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept it because I was convinced\Nthat I would meet you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Try it on! - Don't make\Nfun of me! I'm a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, even if you pretend to be\Na boy, I know you're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't insist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! All right, Sapphire!\NFor now I won't insist,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but please try it on if you have\Nsome free time one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?\NThere's a rock in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- There's another one!\N- Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Water will get in,\Nhurry up and repair it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.26,0:16:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- The water has stopped!\N- It's stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wild Rock!\NThe Wild Rock...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is everything okay, Sapphire?\N- Yes! But what the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Wild Rock!\N- The Wild Rock?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're going to the Black Island,\Nwhere the magic Spring is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'll help you, Sapphire,\Neven if you don't want me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't waste time!\NDon't let the water in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct the course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurrah!\N- Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:17:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Captain, it seems\Nto me that you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...see anything else\Nbesides Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Be more careful from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The island! The island!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, get up, the island is in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel dazed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm going!\N- Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in your places!\NDon't be fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That song is a spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I feel dizzy too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.34,0:19:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, thank you!\NI've finally recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want the sharks to eat you, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will only stop at the Black Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I can't stand working for a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.18,0:19:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, this is the Black Island, where the magic Spring is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, what do you need that saber for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know who you might run into.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, I hear the sound of water. Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!\NIt must be the magic spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, because the bottom is treacherous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wash them with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!\NIt's darker than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wash them! Wash them! Fill your eyes with water and wash them thoroughly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, Sapphire?\N- Blood, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Silver?\NHave you decided to betray me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited so long\Nfor this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Before someone stops\Nme, Blood... On guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can see!\NI can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, you damned traitor!\NCome on, show some guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't fight among yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:21:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! I'm fighting too, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat! You'll be the\Nfirst to die! Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're alone.\NWhat do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.42,0:22:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to fight anymore! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Blood? Wait,\NI want to wash your wound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine, it's just a\Nscratch. You're always so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still prefer the Sapphire\Ndressed like yesterday to this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you say something?\N- No, no, I didn't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.82,0:23:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a truly wonderful thing\Nthat you can see again, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Blood! And I owe\Nall of this only to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sapphire, please,\Nbe careful. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Goodbye, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.18,0:23:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Blood!\NGoodbye to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.62,0:23:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye! Goodbye, Sapphire!\N- Bye, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.34,0:23:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see, now! I will\Nsucceed in defeating...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.66,0:24:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...Queen Icicle and\Nprotecting Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.94,0:24:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father... Mother...\NPlease, wait for me!
